	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  rapport pg_badger vide]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=33020#p33020"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour rjuju,</p><p>Merci pour ta réponse.<br />Voici la valeur du &quot;log_line_prefix&quot; (&#039;%t;%p;%u;%d;%e;&#039;)<br />voici la commande lancé:<br />pgbadger -f syslog -p &#039;%t;%p;%u;%d;%e;&#039; -o /tmp/`uname -n`-$PG_SERVERNAME-`date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S`-PgBadger.out.html /pgqdata/$PG_SERVERNAME/data/pg_log/pgxxxx.log</p><br /><p>Par avance merci</p>]]></content>
